# Harvested real-diff corpora. The diffs belong to their upstream projects, so
# they are regenerated locally from `evals/real_diffs.py harvest` rather than
# committed. Adjudicated verdicts are keyed by commit SHA and can be committed.
evals/data/real_diffs/*.jsonl
evals/data/real_diffs/*.json
!evals/data/real_diffs/verdicts*.jsonl
